&lt;li&gt;Generous, transparent and fair compensation system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract of Employment (and the option of&amp;nbsp; 50% tax deductible costs for author’s rights usage in respect of applicable roles)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
