&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional executive stakeholders across Finance, Legal, and Product to build scalable financial infrastructure that supports business expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, implement, and maintain robust internal controls and accounting policies to safeguard corporate assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor, grow, and empower a diverse, high-performing team, fostering a supportive environment focused on continuous career development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
