lved with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,12&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5014 citation-5015&quot;&gt;. We are obsessed with process improvement in order to help Asana continue to g&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5012 citation-5013 citation-5014 citation-5015 citation-end-5015&quot;&gt;row, scale, and succeed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,14&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-5008 citation-5009 citation-5010 citation-5011 citation-end-5011&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
