&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Agentic Systems Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deep understanding of applied AI, LLM evaluation frameworks, agent/tool orchestration, Model Context Protocol (MCP), proactivity models, and production observability.&lt;/li&gt;
