&lt;p&gt;Become a primary driver of Asana’s new business motion by converting competitive accounts for initial purchases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage the full cycle of complex deals with multiple stakeholders and longer sales cycles, from prospecting and qualification to negotiation and closing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
