&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop a deep understanding of customer goals to uncover new use cases and drive expansion during the term and at renewal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ProsemirrorEditor-listItem&quot; data-list-indent=&quot;1&quot; data-list-type=&quot;bulleted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with marketing, product, and customer success teams to deliver a seamless customer experience and ensure successful onboarding and adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
