&lt;p&gt;- Drive operational excellence and continuous delivery processes, enabling the team to iterate quickly and ship value continuously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Champion accountability for key outcomes, linking your team&#39;s everyday work to Asana&#39;s broader strategic goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;About you&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Demonstrated curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Experience guiding and developing software engineering teams in building scalable web applications, ideally with experience leading 0-1 product development.&lt;/p&gt;
