&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_15afc26ca3fee66b-409&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building an AEO strategy, running experiments, establishing measurement, and driving results in AI answer engines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
