&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_15afc26ca3fee66b-410&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Deep technical SEO fluency across site architecture, structured data/schema, Core Web Vitals, and international SEO, with credibility working alongside engineering teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
