&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_15afc26ca3fee66b-411&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Rigorous, data-driven operating style with experience building models, running experiments, making evidence-based prioritization calls, and applying SQL skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
