&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_15afc26ca3fee66b-417&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0&quot;&gt;In addition to base salary, your compensation package may inc&lt;span class=&quot;citation-7603 citation-end-7603&quot;&gt;lude additional components such as equity, sales incentive pay (for most sales roles), and benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-7602 citation-end-7602&quot;&gt;. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total com&lt;/span&gt;pensation and benefits for this role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
