&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_de1296fc611ea354-112&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1414&quot;&gt;In addition to base salary, your compensation package may include additional components such as equity, sales incentive pay (for most sales roles), and benefits. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1412 citation-1413 citation-1414 citation-end-1414&quot;&gt;speak with your Talent Acquisition Partner to learn more about the total c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1412 citation-1413 citation-end-1413&quot;&gt;ompensation and benefits for this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_de1296fc611ea354-113&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1410 citation-1411 citation-end-1411&quot;&gt;We strive to provide equitable and competitive benefits packages that support our employees worldwide and incl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1410 citation-end-1410&quot;&gt;ude:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;p-rc_de1296fc611ea354-114&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-1409 citation-end-1409&quot;&gt;Mental health, wellness &amp;amp; fitness benefi&lt;/span&gt;ts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career coaching &amp;amp; support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
