&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_ce5dfecf57c71813-316&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain red team tooling, TTPs, and playbooks aligned with current threat actor behaviors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_ce5dfecf57c71813-317&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Oversee security architecture reviews and threat modeling for new features and services, ensuring risks are identified early and secure design decisions are made&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
