&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_ce5dfecf57c71813-321&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrates curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
