&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;Develop deep understanding of customer needs and articulate how Asana can address those pain points by presenting a solution and its business impact&lt;/p&gt;
