&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional partners to identify customer problems, establish vision, set strategy, build and ship solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion product excellence. Elevate the quality bar for our experience and shape our payment design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the organization to ship experiences that are cohesive with the broader Asana product experience, ensuring your design scales.&lt;/li&gt;
