&lt;li&gt;Learn new methods to solve deeply complex problems in the service of inventing new ways to deliver our customer benefits: flow, efficiency, engagement, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape a product that is intuitive and elegant, which speaks from a unified voice.&lt;/li&gt;
