&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives and Solutions Engineers during the pre-sales cycle — scoping custom engagements, assessing technical feasibility, and contributing to deal strategy for complex enterprise opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical strategy for each engagement — from initial scoping and architecture through delivery and handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver scalable, customized solutions — including AI-augmented workflows — that integrate Asana into complex enterprise ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead post-sales delivery from kickoff through close — owning the project lifecycle, writing and reviewing code, and partnering with Customer Success Managers to ensure customers realize lasting value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Implementation Managers to coordinate project delivery, maintain momentum, and hold a high bar for customer experience throughout each engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive regional alignment with global Technical Services standards — raising the bar on delivery quality and ensuring every engagement reflects the practices and expectations that define the global team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate technical feasibility of sophisticated customer use cases and drive alignment on solution strategy across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the EMEA services partner ecosystem — contributing to partner selection based on competency and fit, and serving as a technical stakeholder on partner-led engagements to ensure consistency with global delivery standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify patterns across engagements to build repeatable frameworks, tools, and delivery assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior voice of the customer with Product and Engineering — translating field insights and your own developer experience into roadmap influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in customer-facing technical roles (e.g., Solutions Architect, Technical Consultant, Customer Engineer), with a track record of owning complex enterprise engagements end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of hands-on programming (Python or Node.js required), with deep fluency in REST APIs, webhooks, and integration architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience spanning pre-sales and post-sales technical roles — you&#39;re as comfortable scoping and pricing a complex engagement alongside an AE as you are heads-down in delivery with a customer engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to leverage AI tools — including LLMs, AI coding assistants, and agentic workflows — to accelerate development, enhance solution design, and deliver smarter outcomes for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems thinker — you architect for scale, anticipate failure modes, and build with both today&#39;s constraints and tomorrow&#39;s needs in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically curious and current — you stay ahead of the curve on AI/ML tooling, developer platform trends, and emerging automation patterns, and actively bring that knowledge back to the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive-ready communicator — equally at home in a code editor and a boardroom, with the ability to translate complexity into clarity for any audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owner-operator mindset — you don&#39;t just deliver; you build the systems, playbooks, and team habits that make delivery repeatable at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to operate as a solo regional practitioner within a global team — self-directed and independent day-to-day, while staying tightly aligned to centralized standards, ways of working, and team expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong working relationships across customer and internal stakeholders throughout each engagement, and influence with clarity and empathy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with services partner ecosystems — you know how to assess partner competencies, contribute to selection decisions, and show up as an effective technical stakeholder on engagements where partners are leading delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
